---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于我们 - 格文笔记" description="了解廊坊元云科技有限公司和格文笔记的故事。">
  <!-- 页头 -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand to-brand-light pt-28 pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white">关于我们</h1>
      <p class="text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg mt-4">
        用技术的力量，让阅读回归美好
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 公司介绍 -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16" data-reveal>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">廊坊元云科技有限公司</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          廊坊元云科技有限公司是一家专注于数字内容和阅读技术的科技公司。我们相信阅读的力量，致力于通过技术创新为用户打造更好的数字阅读体验。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8" data-reveal>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-lighter rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <path d="M12 16v-4" />
              <path d="M12 8h.01" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">愿景</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">让每个人都能享受高品质的数字阅读体验</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-lighter rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">使命</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">用技术推动知识传播，用设计提升阅读品质</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-lighter rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">价值观</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">用心做产品，以用户体验为核心驱动力</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 产品故事 -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div data-reveal>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-8 text-center">格文笔记的故事</h2>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm">
          <div class="space-y-5 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              「格文笔记」的名字寓意"格物致知、以文会友"——通过阅读格物明理，以文字为媒介连接志同道合的人。
            </p>
            <p>
              在信息碎片化的时代，我们渴望回归深度阅读的纯粹。格文笔记应运而生，专为那些热爱阅读、追求知识的人打造。我们选择 Markdown 作为内容格式，因为它简洁、优雅、专注于内容本身——这正是我们对阅读的理解。
            </p>
            <p>
              我们不追求大而全，而是专注于把阅读这件事做到极致。从字体排版到翻页体验，从章节导航到进度同步，每一个细节都经过反复打磨。我们希望当你打开格文笔记的那一刻，就能沉浸在文字的世界里。
            </p>
            <p>
              「用书创造美好生活」不只是一句 Slogan，更是我们团队的信念。我们相信，一本好书可以改变一个人的人生轨迹，而一个好的阅读工具可以让更多人爱上阅读。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 联系方式 -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-10 text-center" data-reveal>联系我们</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="bg-surface rounded-2xl p-6 text-center card-hover">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-lighter rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2" />
              <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-1">邮箱</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">support@gewennote.com</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-surface rounded-2xl p-6 text-center card-hover">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-lighter rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-1">地址</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">河北省廊坊市</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-surface rounded-2xl p-6 text-center card-hover">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-lighter rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M15 7h3a5 5 0 0 1 5 5 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-3m-6 0H6a5 5 0 0 1-5-5 5 5 0 0 1 5-5h3" />
              <line x1="8" x2="16" y1="12" y2="12" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-1">官网</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">www.gewennote.com</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
